      "source": [
        "### D2. Store and report\n",
        "\n",
        "Store these three values in well-named variables, then print them one per line:\n",
        "\n",
        "- a record ID of `R-017`\n",
        "- a value of `41.2`\n",
        "- a limit of `50`"
      ],
      "id": "jADUzAW93pW7"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
