        "id": "Gx5Q2YlL3pW8"
      },
      "source": [
        "### D5. Make it tidy\n",
        "\n",
        "Take your D4 output and format it so that:\n",
        "\n",
        "- every number shows exactly **2 decimal places**\n",
        "- the numbers are **right-aligned** so the decimal points line up\n",
        "- the difference always shows its sign (`+3.70` / `-8.80`)"
      ],
      "id": "Gx5Q2YlL3pW8"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "C6eyMnOD3pW8",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "cellView": "form",
        "outputId": "b346b1c8-920f-470c-875c-ae8a4d115f4c"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "record_id: SC-10\n",
            "value: 100\n",
            "limit: 50\n",
            "record_id: SC-10\n",
            "value: 100.00\n",
            "limit: 50.00\n",
            "difference: -50.00\n",
            "percent: 200.00%\n",
            "limit-value -50.0\n",
            "200.0\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "# @title\n",
        "# D5\n",
        "record_id= input(\"record_id: \")\n",
        "value= float(input(\"value: \"))\n",
        "limit= float(input(\"limit: \"))\n",
        "print(f'record_id: {record_id}')\n",
        "print(f'value: {value:.2f}')\n",
        "print(f'limit: {limit:.2f}')\n",
        "print(f'difference: {limit-value:.2f}')\n",
        "print(f'percent: {(value/limit)*100:.2f}%')\n",
        "print(f'limit-value {limit-value:+.1f'})\n",
        "print((value/limit)*100)\n"
      ],
      "id": "C6eyMnOD3pW8"
    },
